<title>HONG KONG: Suwa Int'l interim net rises 15 percent.</title>
<headline>Suwa Int'l interim net rises 15 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   1.00	 vs 0.92</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    1.0	  vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  3.964 gain vs 0.073 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    4.69	 vs 4.09</p>
<p>    Turnover		     309.15     vs 237.45</p>
<p>    Company name		 Suwa International Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  January 2-7, 1997</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   January 13</p>
<p>NOTE - Suwa International is a computer component maker.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on disposal of investment properties in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
